abstract: >-
  Code and data that regenerate every number, table and figure of a two-stage
  planning model for a public e-waste recovery network in Saudi Arabia: set-covering
  siting with a regional equity rule, and a multi-period flow model with workforce
  learning that balances operating profit, operational utilisation and employment by a
  two-phase fuzzy max-min compromise.
